- When a content author replaces or edits an image in the CMS while the preview is open, the corresponding image on the previewed page updates to show the new image without a manual page refresh.
- When a content author edits structured or tabular content in the CMS while the preview is open, the corresponding content on the previewed page updates to reflect the edits without a manual page refresh.
